(A) to make the averages ERA5 profiles, 4608 tiles
---------------------------------------------------

First off 
  edit FIND_NWP_MODEL_TRENDS/driver_computeERA5_monthly_trends_desc_or_asc.m
  run  FIND_NWP_MODEL_TRENDS/driver_computeERA5_monthly_trends_desc_or_asc.m
to make eg
  fERA5_monthly = 'MEAN_PROFILES//avg_ERA5_atm_N_cld_data_2002_09_to_2022_08_desc.mat';
  
Then you need to edit
     driver_makeavgprofile_ERA5_monthly_desc_or_asc.m             or
     driver_makeavgprofile_ERA5_monthly_desc_or_asc_clearonly.m
so you correctly set the start/stop time     
  iStartY = 2002; iStartYM = 09; iStopY = 2021; iStopYM = 08;
  iStartY = 2002; iStartYM = 09; iStopY = 2014; iStopYM = 08; %% Joao wants AMIP/CMIP
  iStartY = 2012; iStartYM = 05; iStopY = 2019; iStopYM = 04; %% CRIS NSR
Run the code. It calls
  [yavg,bady0] = fix_nan_emis(yavg);
so there are no NaNs in emissivity, else SARTA and KCARTA get rightfully annoyed. It makes eg
